    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_013_coin_back_01",
      "hash64": "0B50A4A43766A3BE",
      "text": "最近啊，\\n有～時候會看到硬幣掉在地上。\\r\\n是有人身上已經放不下了嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_013_coin_back_02",
      "hash64": "0B50A3A43766A20B",
      "text": "我在打掃的時候，\\n撿到了有人遺失的硬幣。\\r\\n或許是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的硬幣，就給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
